            "notes": "Current subprocess backend spawns a new claude -p process per agent per step — process overhead + multi-turn tool use makes long simulations infeasible (50k+ calls for realistic step counts). Direct API calls eliminate process spawn, CLI boot, and auth overhead per call."
        },
